{"id":"7ed45c59f7913947","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-forcing-regular-open-algebra.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Regular Open Algebra","display":"df-zfc-forcing-regular-open-algebra — ZFC Forcing Regular Open Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-regular-open-algebra","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-regular-open-algebra","58-df-zfc-forcing4-regular-open-algebra","58-df-zfc-order9-regular-open-algebra-order","58-df-zfc-topo11-regular-open-algebra"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-regular-open-algebra — ZFC Forcing Regular Open Algebra","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-interior.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-regular-open-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-regular-open-algebra</span><span>58-df-zfc-forcing4-regular-open-algebra</span><span>58-df-zfc-order9-regular-open-algebra-order</span><span>58-df-zfc-topo11-regular-open-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-regular-open-algebra — ZFC Forcing Regular Open Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3df866ee4574e842\" href=\"?note=3df866ee4574e842\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-interior.md\">../batch04/58-df-interior.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,\\mathbb P,X,\\tau,R\\in V\">\\(B,\\mathbb P,X,\\tau,R\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> 采用所列依赖中的谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{int}_\\tau^X\">\\(\\operatorname{int}_\\tau^X\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cl}_\\tau^X\">\\(\\operatorname{cl}_\\tau^X\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3df866ee4574e842\" href=\"?note=3df866ee4574e842\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-interior.md\">../batch04/58-df-interior.md</a> 中带载体的算子。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RO}\">\\(\\mathsf{RO}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRegularOpenAlgebra}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRegularOpenAlgebra}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4RegularOpenAlgebra}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4RegularOpenAlgebra}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11RegularOpenAlgebra}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11RegularOpenAlgebra}_S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9RegularOpenAlgebraOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9RegularOpenAlgebraOrder}_S\\)</span> 由下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\to\n\\left(\\mathsf{RO}(X,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\{U\\in\\tau:U=\\operatorname{int}_\\tau^X(\\operatorname{cl}_\\tau^X(U))\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\to\n\\left(\\mathsf{RO}(X,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\{U\\in\\tau:U=\\operatorname{int}_\\tau^X(\\operatorname{cl}_\\tau^X(U))\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRegularOpenAlgebra}_S(B,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\tau_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\tau_{\\mathbb P}=\\{U\\subseteq P:\\forall p\\in U\\;\\forall q\\in P\\;\n(\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\to q\\in U)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(P,\\tau_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land B=\\{U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb P}:U=\\operatorname{int}_{\\tau_{\\mathbb P}}^P(\\operatorname{cl}_{\\tau_{\\mathbb P}}^P(U))\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRegularOpenAlgebra}_S(B,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\tau_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\tau_{\\mathbb P}=\\{U\\subseteq P:\\forall p\\in U\\;\\forall q\\in P\\;\n(\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\to q\\in U)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(P,\\tau_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land B=\\{U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb P}:U=\\operatorname{int}_{\\tau_{\\mathbb P}}^P(\\operatorname{cl}_{\\tau_{\\mathbb P}}^P(U))\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4RegularOpenAlgebra}_S(B,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRegularOpenAlgebra}_S(B,\\mathbb P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4RegularOpenAlgebra}_S(B,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRegularOpenAlgebra}_S(B,\\mathbb P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11RegularOpenAlgebra}_S(B,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\nB=\\{U\\in\\tau:U=\\operatorname{int}_\\tau^X(\\operatorname{cl}_\\tau^X(U))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11RegularOpenAlgebra}_S(B,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\nB=\\{U\\in\\tau:U=\\operatorname{int}_\\tau^X(\\operatorname{cl}_\\tau^X(U))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9RegularOpenAlgebraOrder}_S(B,R,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11RegularOpenAlgebra}_S(B,X,\\tau)\\land\nR=\\{\\langle U,W\\rangle\\in B\\times B:U\\subseteq W\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9RegularOpenAlgebraOrder}_S(B,R,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11RegularOpenAlgebra}_S(B,X,\\tau)\\land\nR=\\{\\langle U,W\\rangle\\in B\\times B:U\\subseteq W\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>保留原来以正则开集族为 B 的约定，不把 B 改成附带布尔运算的数据元组。</li>\n<li>三元与四元谓词现在对任意实参有定义，不再只写在一个未定义函数的取值上。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","sta